page_MrDo0:
	db	248
	db	251
	db	254,1,0,'REVIEW: Mr Do!',255
	db	250,2,0,11,7,72
	db	252,24,8,9,40,1,0
	dw	mrdographic
	db	253,89
	db	22,17,89
	db	'The last couple of years of Speccy homebrew releases have felt like some kind '
	db	'of personal wish-fulfilment dream for the 15-year-old me. All the games I most '
	db	'loved playing in seaside arcades on summer holidays, but which never got decent '
	db	'home conversions for',253,0,' my '
	db	'beloved rubber-keyed buddy, have shown up one after the '
	db	'other in the form of some truly superb ports: Mister Kung Fu, Maze Death Rally-X, '
	db	'Terrapins, Horace And The Robots and most recently the tremendous out-of-the-blue '
	db	'appearance of Astro Blaster. ',232
	db	'Not only are they all wonderfully playable games in the here and now, they also '
	db	'make the past somehow retrospectively better. Because suddenly there',39,'s an '
	db	'alternate universe of the mind where we all got to enjoy them at the time instead '
	db	'of the relatively tatty efforts that actually came out.'
	db	255
	;
page_MrDo1:
	db	248
	db	251
	db	254,1,0,'REVIEW: Mr Do! (Page 2)',255
	db	22,17,0
	db	'But Universal',39,'s colourful and action-packed manic-mining monster-masher from 1982, '
	db	'Mr Do!, was such a big ask for the Spectrum that despite it being a huge hit widely '
	db	'ported to every other format under the sun, nobody had even bothered to take a '
	db	'semi-serious Speccy stab at it until 2006, when Bob Smith produced the gorgeous-looking '
	db	'Farmer Jack In Harvest Havoc. But while it was deftly done, it didn',39,'t do Do!',232
	db	'To experience the iconic bouncing ball, classic Can-Can music and the clever, '
	db	'extra-life-hunting ruleset we had to wait another 13 years for Adrian Singh and '
	db	'Mark R Jones to somehow cram the perky polka-dotted Pierrot into our beloved black rubber buddy.',232
	db	'And what an absolutely phenomenal feat of cramming it is - capturing not only the look and '
	db	'sound of the coin-op but the feel, to the point where you almost forget that '
	db	'you',39,'re not playing the real thing, so similar and familiar are the rhythms '
	db	'and patterns. ',232,'But then, to all intents and purposes, you are.'
	db	231,170,0,32
	db	22,172,0,'Review by Rev. Stuart Campbell.'
	db	255
	;
page_resistance0:
	db	248
