	db	254,1,0,'REVIEW: Resistance',255
	db	250,2,0,3,4,79
	db	250,2,3,3,4,120
	db	250,2,6,3,4,80	
	db	253,73
	db	22,17,73
	db	'By Andy McDermott, 2019',232
	db	'Strangely enough, there are few text adventures for the Spectrum set in WW2, '
	db	'a potentially endless source of inspiration. ',253,0
	db	22,49,0,'It is worth noting, then, that '
	db	'Andy McDermott',39,'s Resistance not only takes its subject matter from the most tragic '
	db	'period of world history, but also gives the player the opportunity of impersonating '
	db	'a really unusual alter ego.',232
	db	'It is 1943 and the protagonist is Mari Roux, a French 17-year old girl living in a small '
	db	'village, whose father was killed during the Nazi invasion. Her mother died of grief soon '
	db	'after',59,' her older brother was forced to work in Germany, and has not been heard '
	db	'of for a year. No wonder, then, that she developed a deep hatred for the invaders.',232
	db	'Offering herself to help the local Resistance, Mari receives one day a note from a '
	db	'man called Jean Agreste, the leader of the local undercover freedom fighters. Agreste '
	db	'will assign her several missions of sabotage and counter-propaganda, such as covering Nazi '
	db	'posters with Resistance ones, exposing a Nazi informer, and even stealing the Nazi flag '
	db	'from the town hall and throwing it '
	db	255
	;
page_resistance1:
	db	248
	db	251
	db	254,1,0,'REVIEW: Resistance (page 2)',255
	db	250,2,0,3,4,79
	db	250,2,3,3,4,120
	db	250,2,6,3,4,80	
	db	253,73
	db	22,17,73
	db	'into a public toilet! After each mission, Mari '
	db	'has to meet Agreste again, who then assigns her another mission, until something very bad happens...'
	db	253,0
	db	232
	db	'The game is then divided into several sub-adventures, and the player, as Mari, will have to '
	db	'perform the assigned tasks without being discovered by the ubiquitous Nazi thugs and their '
	db	'local bootlickers, against which she will even have to fight for her life.',232
	db	'The game is authored with The Quill and text-only. It is not very difficult, '
	db	'so it can be suitable for beginners. Puzzles are linear and do not require an excessive '
	db	'amount of ingenuity. Veterans, on the other hand, will appreciate the unusual and intriguing setting.'
	db	231,132,0,32
	db	22,134,0,'Review by Alessandro Grussu.'
