tip21:	db	'AMSTRAD owners - ensure you get the very best arcade ports by simply buying a ZX Spectrum instead.',232,'A. Sugar, email.',255
tip22:	db	'MILLIONAIRES. Save yourself a lot of trouble by simply paying your maid a living wage to tidy up after any large gathering at your mansion.'
